@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam BorderColor #334155
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
skinparam NoteBorderColor #B6A16C
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 300
title FC-04  Course quiz progress and badge
' Requirements: QUIZ-01 QUIZ-02 QUIZ-03 QUIZ-04 QUIZ-05 QUIZ-06 QUIZ-07 QUIZ-08 PROGRESS-01 PROGRESS-02 REWARD-01 REWARD-02 CONTENT-06 P-03 P-04
start
:Open quiz from student's course revision;
:Resume one unfinished attempt or start a new attempt;
:Save answers automatically and show save status;
:Student submits answers;
if (All questions answered?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :Keep saved answers; identify unanswered questions;
  stop
endif
if (This submission already recorded?) then (yes)
  :Return saved result; do not duplicate attempt or badge;
  stop
else (no)
endif
:Score one point per correct answer;
:Save submitted attempt and keep highest score;
if (Exact highest percentage meets passing threshold?) then (yes)
  :Quiz status is Passed;
else (no)
  :Quiz status remains In progress;
endif
:Show score, correct answers, and explanations;
:Calculate progress from passed required quizzes only;
if (All required quizzes passed?) then (yes)
  :Complete course if not already complete;
  :Award course badge only if not previously earned;
else (no)
  :Keep current progress; optional quizzes do not block completion;
endif
note right
Course progress displays 100% only when every required
quiz in the Student's started revision is passed.
Rounding keeps unfinished progress below 100%.
A later failed retake cannot revoke a pass or badge.
If submission response is lost, check the saved outcome
before offering a retry of the same submission.
end note
stop
footer CS-GAMUERS | FC-04 | Product behavior
@enduml
